' ============================================================================
' 32 The advisory query: rho:vectordb:ann, its checks, and the exact decision.
'
' Source of Figure N16.4 in ../design.md (section N16). The figure restates
' ann, ann_request, query_of, option_k, ann_answer and produce_recorded of
' rholang/src/rust/interpreter/reified/system_processes.rs,
' native_played_reply and native_replayed_reply of
' rholang/src/rust/interpreter/system_processes.rs, and the ids= filter of
' eligible in rholang/src/rust/interpreter/spaces/disciplines/vectordb.rs
' (design v3 section 4.9, decisions 57, 58, 104, 105, 114 and 116). It adds
' no new fact.
'
' Changed by decisions 104, 105 and 114: only play makes the checks, a
' failure replies a base code of DR-114, and the reply has no watermark.
' Before, replay made the checks too (decision 67), each failed check had
' its own Reified code, and the reply ended with the watermark.
'
' Reading order:
'   1. Play makes the checks of the call against consensus state.
'   2. In play, the mirror of the node answers the ids of the nearest
'      records, and play records the reply.
'   3. The ids are hints. A receive with the exact query param ids= turns
'      them into a decision, and the exact order of the records decides.
'   4. Replay makes no check. It checks the record, delivers it, and asks
'      no embedder and no mirror.
'
' Colors come from concept-colors.iuml (aliases of the shared palette).
' Render: ./render.sh 32-advisory-query.puml   Check: ./render.sh --check

@startuml 32-advisory-query
!include ../../../casper/theory/diagrams/palette.iuml
!include concept-colors.iuml
$ca_base_skin()
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor $rrs_relation
  LifeLineBorderColor $rrs_relation
  ParticipantBorderColor $rrs_relation
  ActorBorderColor $rrs_relation
  GroupBorderColor $rrs_relation
  DividerBorderColor $rrs_relation
  DividerBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
}
skinparam NoteBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
title The advisory query: rho:vectordb:ann (decisions 57, 58, 104, 105 and 114)
autonumber

participant "Program\n(a deploy)" as PROG $rrs_host
participant "rho:vectordb:ann\n[0xE0, 0x25]" as ANN $rrs_system
participant "Config record\nC(sid) of the space" as CONFIG $rrs_storage
participant "Embedder and mirror\nof the node" as SERVICES $rrs_service
participant "Event log\n(the produce event of the reply)" as LOG $rrs_substrate
participant "VectorDB space\n(the exact engine)" as SPACE $rrs_agent

== Play on the proposer ==
PROG -> ANN : ann!(ret, space, channel, query, {"k": 5})
group the checks of play (decision 104)
  ANN -> CONFIG : read the config
  CONFIG --> ANN : the family, the params, the dimensions, the capacity
  ANN -> ANN : a native VectorDB space with a mirror?\na text, or a numeric vector of the dimensions\nwith finite f32 values?\na map of the one key k, an Int in [1, capacity]?
  ANN -> ANN : a failed check gives\n[false, "EXT_BAD_ARG", "vectordb_ann: invalid argument"]
end
opt the query is a text
  ANN -> SERVICES : embed the text
  SERVICES --> ANN : one vector of the dimensions
end
ANN -> SERVICES : query(collection, channel digest, vector, k)
SERVICES --> ANN : the ids and distances of at most k neighbours\n(a failure gives [false, "EXT_FAILED",\n"vectordb_ann: external service failed"])
ANN -> ANN : native_played_reply: a success that is plain data\nand fits the record room of the deploy
ANN -> LOG : produce the reply on ret, recorded:\n[true, ids, distances], with no watermark (decision 114)
LOG --> PROG : the reply
PROG -> SPACE : for (x <- docs ~ (q; ids=ids, k=1)) { ... }
SPACE -> SPACE : eligible: only stored records whose id is in ids\na stale id names no record and selects nothing\nthe exact order decides among the others
note right of SPACE
  The ids are hints. Only the exact query
  param ids= turns them into a decision,
  so a stale mirror gives weaker advice
  and never changes consensus state.
end note

== Replay on another node ==
PROG -> ANN : the same call, in replay: no check of the call
ANN -> ANN : native_replayed_reply: an empty record,\nor a record that is not plain data,\nfails the replay with BugFoundError
ANN -> LOG : produce the recorded reply on ret
note over SERVICES
  Replay asks no embedder
  and no mirror.
end note
LOG --> PROG : the recorded reply
PROG -> SPACE : the same exact query, the same decision

legend bottom
**Concept colors**
|<$rrs_host>       | the program of the deploy |
|<$rrs_system>     | the system process |
|<$rrs_storage>    | the records of the space: its config |
|<$rrs_service>    | the node services outside consensus |
|<$rrs_substrate>  | the event log of the deploy |
|<$rrs_agent>      | the space agent: the exact engine |
endlegend
@enduml
